# Nigeria FOV thumbnail sheets for the LBP variants: the same 8 images already committed
# for v2.2, differing only in the predicted-bucket captions. 3.3 MB each; nigeria_081226.py
# regenerates them, and the finding they support is a table in lbp-runtime/README.md.
crowding-crenation/data/results/nigeria-081226/fov-thumbnails-nolbp*.png

